                        "glosses": [
                            "A poisonous material, extracted from the seeds of plants of species Anamirta cocculus, used as a stimulant; it is a complex of two alkaloids: picrotoxinin and picrotin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
